WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Lily answers Ryu’s recorded Drive Impact with her own.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:04.300
The counter Drive Impact wins the armor exchange.

3
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:04.900
Jumping heavy kick picks up the crumple.

4
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:05.750
Forward heavy punch continues the juggle.

5
00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.850
Wind-enhanced heavy Condor Spire finishes the no-Super route.

6
00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.450
Ryu falls after the heavy wind Spire.
